Monster is an abstract class:
	Use a constructor to initialize variables
	- String for Name
	- int for Health
	- Enum for Damage type 
	- int for Damage output
	- int for Offense level
	- int for Defence level
	- ArrayList<Enum> for debuffs

	Abstract double attack()
	Public double specialAttack()
	Public void block()

If attacked: do zero damage

Regular Monster inherits Monster: 
	Public double attack(damage output, damage type)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Return dmg 

Brute inherits Monster: 
	Initialize:
		- Bleed dmg
		- Bleed chance
	Public double attack(damage output, damage type, bleed dmg, bleed chance)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Inflict bleed (50%)
Return dmg & bleed dmg

